  m_Name: king_intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: King
  portraits:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: cb0c139a2486cf641af0c4c170cff6e7, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: cd2252702510e1b4283947f32e751599, type: 3}
  dialogueBoxImage: {fileID: 1301518215, guid: dfc348bf49832804086a1e00827d2ec2, type: 3}
  sentences:
  - "Ah... you\u2019ve come at last."
  - I feared we had lost you to the shadows like the others.
  - Dark times have fallen upon the realm, my child.
  - "The Elemelons\u2014the sacred fruits of balance..."
  - have been stolen from my castle.
  - "It was her\u2026 The Void Witch."
  - Once a guardian of the arcane, now twisted by greed.
  - "She\u2019s turned against us\u2026 and cloaked herself in darkness."
  - You, alone, may stand against her.
  - To reclaim balance, you must retrieve the Earth Elemelon.
  - The Elemelon of endurance and stability.
  - It was the first she took.
  - Hidden away beyond the South Room of this castle,
  - ' a portal is hidden.'
  - One that pulses with the essence of earth... ancient and wild.
  - This portal will bring you to her hideout.
  - "But beware\u2014she has summoned monsters to guard her lair."
  - Beasts of soil and stone, fueled by her vile will.
  - I ask this not as your King...
  - "\u2026but as one who still believes in the light within you."
  - 'Venture forth. Enter the Earth Portal. '
  - "Face what lies beyond\u2014and return to us with the Elemelon."
  - The fate of the realm rests in your hands.
  imageSprite: {fileID: 0}
